{"id":18414,"date":"2023-09-17T21:58:20","date_gmt":"2023-09-17T21:58:20","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/?page_id=18414"},"modified":"2023-09-17T22:58:08","modified_gmt":"2023-09-17T22:58:08","slug":"skai-johnson","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/skai-johnson\/","title":{"rendered":"Skai Johnson"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft size-thumbnail wp-image-18413\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/Skai-Johnson-Headshot-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" \/>Introducing the newest addition to the JAMMIN&#8217; DJs squad all the way from sunny Los Angeles, California \u2013 Skai, affectionately known as &#8220;The Captain&#8221;! Skai has been setting dance floors ablaze with his groovy beats since the electrifying year of 2008. With a degree in dance under his belt, he&#8217;s not only a DJ extraordinaire but also a seasoned professional emcee, making him the ultimate maestro of merriment.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">When he&#8217;s not spinning tracks and working his magic on the mic, you can find Skai &#8220;The Captain&#8221; indulging in his passion for various interests. He&#8217;s a culinary connoisseur who loves whipping up delicious dishes, a basketball enthusiast who&#8217;s always up for a game, a semi-pro table tennis player who knows how to keep the competition fierce, and a crystal aficionado who enjoys the art of wire wrapping.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">As for <strong>Skai&#8217;s favorite playgrounds, he thrives at the following types of gatherings:<\/strong> dance parties where he turns the music into pure energy, runway fashion shows where he creates the perfect musical backdrop for models to strut their stuff, and intimate gatherings where he crafts an atmosphere of unforgettable moments.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">So, get ready to set sail on a musical voyage with &#8220;The Captain&#8221; himself, Skai, as he brings his charisma, beats, and boundless energy to a party near you!<\/span><\/p>\n<div><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>What&#8217;s in Skai&#8217;s Headphones:<\/strong> \u00a0Westside Boogie, Saba, Bakar, Snoh Alegra, Summer Walker, fred again., and Peggy Gou<\/span><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Introducing the newest addition to the JAMMIN&#8217; DJs squad all the way from sunny Los Angeles, California \u2013 Skai, affectionately known as &#8220;The Captain&#8221;! Skai has been setting dance floors ablaze with his groovy beats since the electrifying year of 2008. With a degree in dance under his belt, he&#8217;s not only a DJ extraordinaire&hellip;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-18414","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.7 (Yoast SEO v26.7) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Skai Johnson - JAMMIN&#039; DJs Georgia &amp; Tennessee<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/skai-johnson\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Skai Johnson\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Introducing the newest addition to the JAMMIN&#8217; DJs squad all the way from sunny Los Angeles, California \u2013 Skai, affectionately known as &#8220;The Captain&#8221;! Skai has been setting dance floors ablaze with his groovy beats since the electrifying year of 2008. With a degree in dance under his belt, he&#82